 by Frasers Group regarding its intention to increase its shareholding in HUGO BOSS beyond 50% as well as its review of support for Stephan Sturm, Chairman of the Supervisory Board of HUGO BOSS."]},{"type":"p","children":["The termination does not reflect any change in the Company's confidence in its strategy and long-term value creation potential. The Company's capital allocation framework remains unchanged, and the Managing Board will reassess a share buyback program as appropriate."]},{"type":"p","children":["Investor Relations"]},{"type":"p","children":["Contact"]},{"type":"p","children":["Christian Stöhr"]},{"type":"p","children":["Senior Vice President Investor Relations"]},{"type":"p","children":["Phone: +49 7123 94-87563"]},{"type":"p","children":["Email: christian_stoehr@hugoboss.com"]},"  End of Inside Information",{"type":"p","children":["01-Sep-2026 CET/CEST The EQS Distribution Services include Regulatory Announcements, Financial/Corporate News and Press Releases."]}]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["Language:"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["English"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["Company:"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["HUGO BOSS AG"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["Holy-Allee 3"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["72555 Metzingen"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["Germany"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["Phone:"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["+49 (0)712 394-0"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["Fax:"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["+49 (0)712 394-802